		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Bipedal beetle-ogre with an ochre, chitinous shell and mandibles that spatter acid. Devour what they kill.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d8) or 1 acid spray, <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow, climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Spray</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending near from myrmecoleon. DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Death Throes</strong>. When slain, explodes in acidic near-sized cube centered on beetle-ogre. CON 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
